{"relevant": true, "layer": "company", "reason": "The company regulation sets payroll parameters that enter the PPh 21 computation for its permanent employees: JKK 0.54% and JKM 0.30% employer-paid premiums (added to gross income), JHT 5.7% (2% employee) and JP 3% (1% employee) with a JP wage cap of Rp9,559,600 fixed for the whole policy period (employee JHT/JP shares are deductions from gross income), BPJS Kesehatan 5% with a Rp12,000,000 wage cap (4% employer-paid, added to gross income), and non-fixed meal and transport allowances per attendance day that form part of gross income. Valid 1 April 2023 to 31 March 2025.", "quotes": [
